{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）凌晨3時16分，警方巡經金鐘政府總部對開夏慤道東行線時，發現一輛凌志私家車形迹可疑，於是截停調查，結果在車上檢獲一批可卡因和氯胺</p><p>警方其後召來緝毒犬協助搜索，檢獲毒品的數量有待進一步確定，疑犯被帶署調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129330719634493440081765.jpeg/Y296j_UmID_mYZEXAmktFc8BpJgNfgBfRGgtg0RoLYM\" alt=\"警方在場調查。\"><figcaption>警方在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129331030625357824758236.jpeg/TQBrbVLshjV0gUjui9nzNBnno3G01j1zl9LQFpfS0BY\" alt=\"警方在車上檢獲毒品。\"><figcaption>警方在車上檢獲毒品。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T01:13:02.592860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}